+# Version numbering scheme
+
+No version numbering scheme for this project's releases is currently recorded. `Cargo.toml` sets `workspace.package.version = "0.1.0"` as a value, but no document in the repository (README, design/ENGINE.md, docs/threat-model.md, docs/format.md, research/CONCLUSION.md, research/00-evidence-log.md, or the CI workflow) states a decision — such as SemVer, CalVer, or any other scheme — governing how that version number is chosen or incremented.
